  "body": "<!--\r\n⚠️ If you do not respect this template, your pull request will be closed.\r\n⚠️ Your pull request title should be short detailed and understandable for all.\r\n⚠️ Also, please add it in the CHANGELOG file under Unreleased section.\r\n⚠️ If your pull request fixes an open issue, please link to the issue.\r\n\r\n✅ I have added the tests to cover my changes.\r\n✅ I have updated the documentation accordingly.\r\n✅ I have read the CONTRIBUTING document.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n### Summary\r\n\r\n- Adds `qiskit_optimization.algorithms.OptimizationResult.prettyprint` to display a multi-line text.\r\n- Adds `wrap` option to `prettyprint` function and method to set the text width.\r\n- Updates `str` and `repr` of `QuadraticProgram` and `OptimizationResult` to be a one-line text.\r\n- Reword \"optimal\" in `OptimizationResult` and `OptimizationResultStatus` because some algorithms do not guarantee the optimality.\r\n  - \"optimal solution\" (`OptimizationResultStatus.SUCCESS`) -> \"feasible solution\"\r\n  - \"optimal function value\" (`OptimizationResult.fval`) -> \"objective function value\"\r\n  - \"optimal value\" (`OptimizationResult.x`) -> \"variable values\"\r\n\r\n\r\nTODO\r\n- [x] Refactors `repr` and `str` of `QuadraticProgram` and `OptimizationResult` to be one line\r\n- [x] Adds `OptimizationResult.prettyprint` to generate a multi-line string\r\n- [x] Updates docstrings of `OptimizationResults` and `OptimizationResultStatus`\r\n- [x] Updates tutorials to replace `export_as_lp_string` with `prettyprint`\r\n- [x] Updates reno \r\n\r\nCloses #184\r\nCloses #77\r\n\r\nFollow-up of #366 #369\r\n\r\n### Details and comments\r\n\r\n`QuadraticProgram`\r\n```python\r\nfrom qiskit_optimization.problems import QuadraticProgram\r\n\r\nqp = QuadraticProgram('problem 1')\r\nqp.integer_var(-1, 2, 'x')\r\nqp.integer_var(-1, 2, 'y')\r\nqp.continuous_var(-1, name='z')\r\nqp.minimize(constant=3, linear={'x': 2, 'y': 3}, quadratic={('z', 'x'): -1})\r\nqp.linear_constraint({'x': 1, 'y': -2}, '>=', 2, name='lin_GE')\r\nqp.linear_constraint({'x': 2, 'y': -1}, '==', 1, name='lin_EQ')\r\nqp.quadratic_constraint({'x': 2, 'y': -1}, {('z', 'z'): -1}, '<=', 1)\r\n\r\nprint(repr(qp))\r\nprint()\r\nprint(str(qp))\r\nprint()\r\nprint(qp.prettyprint())\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\n<QuadraticProgram: minimize -x*z + 2*x + 3*y + 3, 3 variables, 3 constraints, 'problem 1'>\r\n\r\nminimize -x*z + 2*x + 3*y + 3 (3 variables, 3 constraints, 'problem 1')\r\n\r\nProblem name: problem 1\r\n\r\nMinimize\r\n  -x*z + 2*x + 3*y + 3\r\n\r\nSubject to\r\n  Linear constraints (2)\r\n    x - 2*y >= 2  'lin_GE'\r\n    2*x - y == 1  'lin_EQ'\r\n\r\n  Quadratic constraints (1)\r\n    -z^2 + 2*x - y <= 1  'q0'\r\n\r\n  Integer variables (2)\r\n    -1 <= x <= 2\r\n    -1 <= y <= 2\r\n\r\n  Continuous variables (1)\r\n    -1 <= z\r\n```\r\n-----------------------\r\n\r\n`OptimizationResult`\r\n\r\n```python\r\nfrom qiskit_optimization.problems import QuadraticProgram\r\nfrom qiskit_optimization.algorithms import OptimizationResult, OptimizationResultStatus\r\n\r\nqp = QuadraticProgram()\r\nx = qp.binary_var_list(3)\r\nresult = OptimizationResult([1.0,2.0,3.0], 10.0, x, OptimizationResultStatus.SUCCESS)\r\n\r\nprint(str(result))\r\nprint()\r\nprint(repr(result))\r\nprint()\r\nprint(str(result.prettyprint()))\r\n```\r\n\r\n```\r\nfval=10.0, x0=1.0, x1=2.0, x2=3.0, status=SUCCESS\r\n\r\n<OptimizationResult: fval=10.0, x0=1.0, x1=2.0, x2=3.0, status=SUCCESS>\r\n\r\nobjective function value: 10.0\r\nvariable values: x0=1.0, x1=2.0, x2=3.0\r\nstatus: SUCCESS\r\n```",
